{"2026.6.4:P02-Q12":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>工业废料中镉锰的选择性沉淀</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.4 · 2025湖南高考真题 · 原题12 · P02-Q12</div><h1>工业废料中镉锰的选择性沉淀</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/沉淀溶解平衡的应用</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：根据溶度积和试剂选择判断沉淀分离次序及离子方程式。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/溶度积</span><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/物质的分离、提纯</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学反应速率/影响化学反应速率的因素</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:2141e791a1b719a61a51d99edf5182b7276341bb90039599f96a9d5942fc51a7:0;\" style=\"width:333.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>12. 工业废料的综合处理有利于减少环境污染并实现资源循环利用。从某工业废料中回收镉、锰的部分工艺流程如下：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:a1580926d38209b7b21c496e1771e1cafa5404e84b29e81a8aedfe7f420aae23:1;\" style=\"width:401.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>已知：①富集液中两种金属离子浓度相当。</p><p>②常温下，金属化合物的<img src=\"chem-asset:8f484ef781003ed7040c78667b77af4d77e872722125990eba13da51832910ed:2;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">：</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>金属化合物</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:d65e8ef1e0498af5dc23f6befbced72e08a6dfcbae1a3a825e020ec8e8f1d1a2:3;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:37c97b3f4f53371d41a9b85a5ef821f088791641abcd08d0907454f3a6e8aaee:4;\" style=\"width:51.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:14df05e236e1a23a8d7274a879bfd0263ae3a696544f50afd42fb4ad3ff2eef5:5;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:0538ad206992cd35270b2b92174e4af9c7c838f3945b4e32ad2a6d1311bc5886:6;\" style=\"width:54.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:8f484ef781003ed7040c78667b77af4d77e872722125990eba13da51832910ed:2;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:8c365072c6694f2009ea6fcebcf234ea2ca22da4dbab210e353ed84150a5b22e:7;\" style=\"width:66.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:a247eec4f8f6b9a47ea9cc68e72b3ab95fef6bcca7af17233ecdc496fd5aff9f:8;\" style=\"width:65.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:ed7473f7fe740c067e082b5c075fc921862165a0db9779b9b74400d4bf6d2591:9;\" style=\"width:67.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><img src=\"chem-asset:7e771e35a1fef174b57d023d1c316cd234ddd5a1a43a6837c2db2e762046fae3:10;\" style=\"width:65.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></td></tr></table></div><p>下列说法错误的是</p><p>A. 粉碎工业废料有利于提高金属元素的浸出率</p><p>B. 试剂X可以是<img src=\"chem-asset:91a6897bfae14d9763f361c8f49ab49f0a007f71a26f2ffb5fdce6be68b8e325:11;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液</p><p>C. “沉镉”和“沉锰”的顺序不能对换</p><p>D. “沉锰”时，发生反应<img src=\"chem-asset:63ab25b246f36843e824036661d0c79586bbc7cae0077faec38699c471d085f5:12;\" style=\"width:14.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">离子方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:75cb74add98d6265b217be8bc5c3324c00ca686a3de6f80ab035fa58904c1b30:13;\" style=\"width:206.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】富集液中含有两种金属离子<img src=\"chem-asset:b1958cdf6f059c053a740a8407e704161ea999e3502d1b02cffe844300ac9e8d:14;\" style=\"width:84.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，其浓度相当，加入试剂X沉铬，由金属化合物的<img src=\"chem-asset:8f484ef781003ed7040c78667b77af4d77e872722125990eba13da51832910ed:2;\" style=\"width:25.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">可知，CdCO<sub>3</sub>、MnCO<sub>3</sub>的<img src=\"chem-asset:e74a1c54e299441b1ceaa004c3a6670d3fe6773976521a70070e5e82a1174673:15;\" style=\"width:27.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">接近，不易分离，则试剂X选择含<img src=\"chem-asset:bae5948b0dded89f8d6ca5bb78c36ff5e2048b18f8d81bf7b8c513b72df58c36:16;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的试剂，得到CdS滤饼，加入<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:17;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液沉锰，发生反应：<img src=\"chem-asset:f8c0c0a3756f8909afdb9e0870d8a17f529d4826a50ca84ba1139ce9405f87c9:18;\" style=\"width:280.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，据此解答。</p><p>【详解】A．粉碎工业废料能增大废料与浸出液的接触面积，有利于提高金属元素的浸出率，A正确；</p><p>B．由分析可知，试剂X可以是<img src=\"chem-asset:91a6897bfae14d9763f361c8f49ab49f0a007f71a26f2ffb5fdce6be68b8e325:11;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，B正确；</p><p>C．若先加入<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:17;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液进行“沉锰”，由题中信息以及<img src=\"chem-asset:e74a1c54e299441b1ceaa004c3a6670d3fe6773976521a70070e5e82a1174673:15;\" style=\"width:27.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">数据可知，金属离子<img src=\"chem-asset:b1958cdf6f059c053a740a8407e704161ea999e3502d1b02cffe844300ac9e8d:14;\" style=\"width:84.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">浓度相当，则<img src=\"chem-asset:88373344250bbd8dfd1538741f4339bfc2e2a27208cf2302acad72b30ae32700:19;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">也会沉淀，后续流程中无法分离Cd和Mn，所以“沉镉”和“沉锰”的顺序不能对换，C正确；</p><p>D．“沉锰”时，发生反应的离子方程式是：<img src=\"chem-asset:f8c0c0a3756f8909afdb9e0870d8a17f529d4826a50ca84ba1139ce9405f87c9:18;\" style=\"width:280.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D错误；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.4\\精品解析：2025年高考湖南卷化学高考真题解析（参考版）\\精品解析：2025年湖南高考真题化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.4/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A2025%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%B7%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A2025%E5%B9%B4%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0538ad206992cd35270b2b92174e4af9c7c838f3945b4e32ad2a6d1311bc5886","14df05e236e1a23a8d7274a879bfd0263ae3a696544f50afd42fb4ad3ff2eef5","2141e791a1b719a61a51d99edf5182b7276341bb90039599f96a9d5942fc51a7","37c97b3f4f53371d41a9b85a5ef821f088791641abcd08d0907454f3a6e8aaee","4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040","63ab25b246f36843e824036661d0c79586bbc7cae0077faec38699c471d085f5","75cb74add98d6265b217be8bc5c3324c00ca686a3de6f80ab035fa58904c1b30","7e771e35a1fef174b57d023d1c316cd234ddd5a1a43a6837c2db2e762046fae3","88373344250bbd8dfd1538741f4339bfc2e2a27208cf2302acad72b30ae32700","8c365072c6694f2009ea6fcebcf234ea2ca22da4dbab210e353ed84150a5b22e","8f484ef781003ed7040c78667b77af4d77e872722125990eba13da51832910ed","91a6897bfae14d9763f361c8f49ab49f0a007f71a26f2ffb5fdce6be68b8e325","a1580926d38209b7b21c496e1771e1cafa5404e84b29e81a8aedfe7f420aae23","a247eec4f8f6b9a47ea9cc68e72b3ab95fef6bcca7af17233ecdc496fd5aff9f","b1958cdf6f059c053a740a8407e704161ea999e3502d1b02cffe844300ac9e8d","bae5948b0dded89f8d6ca5bb78c36ff5e2048b18f8d81bf7b8c513b72df58c36","d65e8ef1e0498af5dc23f6befbced72e08a6dfcbae1a3a825e020ec8e8f1d1a2","e74a1c54e299441b1ceaa004c3a6670d3fe6773976521a70070e5e82a1174673","ed7473f7fe740c067e082b5c075fc921862165a0db9779b9b74400d4bf6d2591","f8c0c0a3756f8909afdb9e0870d8a17f529d4826a50ca84ba1139ce9405f87c9"],"sourceSha256":"4a63ddcc12cf7a7697686e88ef54a80aac920ed4ae2e87266ca7fafa0173060e"}}